{
  "_comment": "Vertical video art at 1080x1920, for Shorts, Reels and TikTok. The counterpart to the thumbnail graph and fixed for the same reason: the platforms' number is not negotiable, so reading it from settings would only allow it to be wrong. Scaled to cover and centre-cropped — a face squashed to fit reads as amateur at any resolution, and vertical is where faces mostly are.",
